     from rraadd__ggeett__aattttrr()) are passed to rraadd__ggeett__vveennddoorr__aattttrr(), and are ad‐
     justed to point to the vendor specific attribute data.

     The common types of attributes can be decoded using rraadd__ccvvtt__aaddddrr(),
     rraadd__ccvvtt__iinntt(), and rraadd__ccvvtt__ssttrriinngg().  These functions accept a pointer to
